Completed the accessibility/i18n audit of `mobile/app/settings.tsx`. Key fix: the "Save prefs" CTA now has `accessibilityLiveRegion="polite"` plus role/state/label, so screen readers announce the "Saved ✓" feedback that was previously only visible to sighted users. Also added `accessibilityRole`/`accessibilityState` to the shared `Chip` toggle (covers ~10 toggle groups in one place) and the remaining ~20 interactive `Pressable`/`TextInput` elements in the file, all reusing existing localized strings — no new i18n keys needed. Verified with `tsc --noEmit`; no new type errors. RESULT written to `tasks/admin-queue/done/080-settings-save-feedback-RESULT.md`.
